  "bodyHowArmTitle": "Upper arm",
  "@bodyHowArmTitle": {
    "description": "How to measure heading."
  },
  "bodyHowArmBody": "Find the midpoint between the bony tip of your shoulder and the point of your elbow, at the back of the arm. With the arm relaxed and hanging loosely, wrap the tape around the arm at that point. Tensing the muscle changes the reading. Measure the left and right arm separately.",
